## DC 9 — Significant Changes During the Period

During the audit period, AWS (EU regions only) was added as a carved-out subservice organisation to host Anthropic-model inference for the SaaS open-platform mode [effective date to confirm at issuance]. The change followed the change-management and vendor-onboarding process: AWS vendor due diligence and its SOC 2 report were recorded in Vanta, and the subprocessor addition was notified to customers under the DPA with implementation deferred more than 30 days after notice. The DPA subprocessor list (Appendix B) was updated accordingly.

No other significant changes have been identified as of the draft cut-off date. This section will be re-verified prior to issuance against (a) merges to the default branch on or after 2026-05-04, (b) the Linear "Change" issue type, (c) published release notes, and (d) the Vanta vendor inventory and "Subprocessor Change" records.
